      <section class="section" id="code">
        <h2 id="7-コアネットワークポリシー-json-cli-例"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128187;</span> 7. コアネットワークポリシー JSON / CLI 例</h2>

        <h3 id="セグメント共有の設定">セグメント共有の設定</h3>
        <div class="code-tabs">
          <div class="tab-buttons" role="tablist">
            <button class="tab-btn active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="s1">JSON: 基本共有</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="s2">JSON: except 除外</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="s3">JSON: deny-filter</button>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-content active" role="tabpanel" id="panel-s1">
            <pre><code><span class="json-comment">// Shared Services を Prod, Dev と共有</span>
{
  <span class="json-key">"segment-actions"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="json-key">"action"</span>: <span class="json-string">"share"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"mode"</span>: <span class="json-string">"attachment-route"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"segment"</span>: <span class="json-string">"shared-services"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"share-with"</span>: [<span class="json-string">"prod"</span>, <span class="json-string">"dev"</span>]
    }
  ]
}
<span class="json-comment">// ※ prod と dev の間では直接共有されない</span>
<span class="json-comment">// ※ スタティックルートは共有対象外</span></code></pre>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-content" role="tabpanel" id="panel-s2">
            <pre><code><span class="json-comment">// 全セグメントと共有（dev, prod を除外）</span>
{
  <span class="json-key">"segment-actions"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="json-key">"action"</span>: <span class="json-string">"share"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"mode"</span>: <span class="json-string">"attachment-route"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"segment"</span>: <span class="json-string">"shared-services"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"share-with"</span>: {
        <span class="json-key">"except"</span>: [<span class="json-string">"dev"</span>, <span class="json-string">"prod"</span>]
      }
    }
  ]
}
<span class="json-comment">// "*" 全セグメントから except で指定分を除外</span></code></pre>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-content" role="tabpanel" id="panel-s3">
            <pre><code><span class="json-comment">// deny-filter で test→shared の一方向を遮断</span>
{
  <span class="json-key">"segments"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="json-key">"name"</span>: <span class="json-string">"shared-services"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"deny-filter"</span>: [<span class="json-string">"test"</span>]
    },
    { <span class="json-key">"name"</span>: <span class="json-string">"test"</span> }
  ],
  <span class="json-key">"segment-actions"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="json-key">"action"</span>: <span class="json-string">"share"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"mode"</span>: <span class="json-string">"attachment-route"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"segment"</span>: <span class="json-string">"shared-services"</span>,
      <span class="json-key">"share-with"</span>: [<span class="json-string">"test"</span>]
    }
  ]
}
<span class="json-comment">// shared→test: OK / test→shared: 拒否</span></code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>

